  "draft_py": "# Overcome: Basri, Devoted Paladin's [-6] body (\"Creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain flying\n# until end of turn\") with trample, as the sorcery's effect. The compiler gave no tree at all.\nyours = Selector(\n    count=QUnbounded(),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n    )),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nabilities = [\n    SpellAbility(\n        kind=SpellKind.SORCERY,\n        effect=Seq(steps=(\n            A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n                'target': yours,\n                'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.TRAMPLE),\n                'duration': DurationEot(),\n                'target': yours,\n            }),\n        )),\n    ),\n]\n",
  "clauses": [
